# Architecture rules

## Layout

| Layer | Path | Responsibility |
|-------|------|----------------|
| HTTP routes | `pebble/server/router.py` | Dispatch only |
| Handlers | `pebble/server/<feature>.py` | `run_*` functions; parse request, call domain |
| Domain | `pebble/<module>.py` | Pure logic, Supabase, filesystem |
| Engine shell | `pebble_engine.py` | `PebbleHandler` wiring, `main()` — **no new business logic** |
| Frontend | `ui/v3/` | Next.js app |
| Tests | `tests/test_<feature>.py` | Mirror `pebble/` modules |
| Prod checks | `scripts/verify_*_prod.py` | User-facing API smoke |

## Adding a feature

1. Route in `pebble/server/router.py`
2. Handler in `pebble/server/<name>.py`
3. Logic in `pebble/<name>.py` if non-trivial
4. `tests/test_<name>.py` + e2e if public API
5. `scripts/verify_<name>_prod.py` if Marc-facing
6. Run `python scripts/verify_all.py`

## Do not

- Add logic blocks to `pebble_engine.py` (delegate to `pebble/server/`)
- Claim done without `VERIFICATION_REPORT.md` PASS

See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) and [docs/ONBOARDING.md](docs/ONBOARDING.md).
